cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results, cite them via this metadata."
title: "Hadamard-T: T-matrix witnesses and the Hadamard orders they close"
abstract: >-
  Thirteen Hadamard orders — 2884, 3668, 4532, 5764, 6812, 7004, 7172, 7828,
  8476, 8908, 9476, 9956 and 11948 — constructed by the Cooper–Wallis product
  and machine-verified in exact integer arithmetic, each landing on an entry
  listed unresolved in Cati–Pasechnik Table 4 v2 (arXiv:2411.18897v2,
  2025-08-30); with the periodic T-matrix quadruples at orders 103, 101, 113,
  131, 163 and 181 they are built from. Provenance: the order-103 quadruple
  is decoded from the publicly posted Hadamard matrix of order 2060 and
  carries no priority claim. AI-generated results with a human managing the
  workflow — produced by Claude Code (Fable 5, Anthropic); external reviews
  by GPT 5.6 (OpenAI) and by Grok (xAI), intaken and adjudicated; see
  DISCLOSURE.md.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-29
